index 3cdf1cc..d4bd905 100644
--- a/docs/progress.md
+++ b/docs/progress.md
@@ -612,19 +612,19 @@ aviso no console é o `THREE.Clock` já aceito.
 **Bake.** 2048², 128 amostras, OIDN. Total **3758 s (~63 min)**, contra ~2 h 10
 antes.
 
